    "A backup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A backup"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une sauvegarde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup holds your places, things, history, dates, kits and trips. You choose which photos and documents to include. Backups aren't encrypted. Anyone with the file can read it. Save it somewhere private, like iCloud Drive or Files on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A backup holds your places, things, history, dates, kits and trips. You choose which photos and documents to include. Backups aren't encrypted. Anyone with the file can read it. Save it somewhere private, like iCloud Drive or Files on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une sauvegarde contient vos endroits, objets, historique, dates, kits et voyages. Vous choisissez les photos et documents à inclure. Les sauvegardes ne sont pas chiffrées : toute personne qui a le fichier peut le lire. Gardez-le en lieu sûr, par exemple dans iCloud Drive ou Fichiers sur cet iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A date in this backup is damaged." : {
      "localizations" : {
